{"meta":{"id":"http-client","category":"it/syntax/java/network","title":"HttpClient (동기 · 비동기) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"HttpClient send(동기) / sendAsync(비동기), JSON → 클래스 변환","tags":["java","f-network","f-async"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">HttpClient (동기 · 비동기) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> HttpClient send(동기) / sendAsync(비동기), JSON → 클래스 변환</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">HttpClient (Java 11+)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">HttpClient client = HttpClient.newHttpClient();\r\nHttpRequest req = HttpRequest.newBuilder(URI.create(&quot;https://api.example.com/users/1&quot;))\r\n    .header(&quot;Accept&quot;, &quot;application/json&quot;)\r\n    .GET().build();\r\n\r\n// 동기 — 응답이 올 때까지 이 스레드가 기다림\r\nHttpResponse&lt;String&gt; res = client.send(req, HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofString());\r\nUser user = objectMapper.readValue(res.body(), User.class);   // JSON → 타입\r\n\r\n// 비동기 — CompletableFuture 반환\r\nclient.sendAsync(req, HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofString())\r\n      .thenApply(HttpResponse::body)\r\n      .thenAccept(System.out::println);</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Spring 에서는 RestTemplate(동기) / WebClient · RestClient 를 주로 사용</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › fetch 와 응답 타입</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/network/http-client","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/java/network"}],"hasImage":false}